# Pricing (two systems)

## Bachelor / Master

- **UI:** `.kalkulator-wse` in `template-parts/prices/calculator.php`.
- **Wiring:** `section_tuition_fees.php` → `bachelor-master/section-tuition-calculator.php` (needs post meta `logical_sync_key`).
- **Data:** `akademiataPrices.googleApiUrl` (Apps Script); JS `assets/src/js/prices-calculator.js` (bundled in `main.js`); optional fallback `prices.json`.
- **Offer listing promos filter:** virtual filter from same `PROMOS` JSON — `configure/offer-promotions-filter.php`; sidebar group under Miasto on `page-offer.php`; public URL `?promo=` (alias of form `promotions[]`; taxonomy `promotions` has `query_var => false` so WP does not steal the param). **Listing filter by UI lang:** EN site → only `lng: en` promos (e.g. `absolwent_en`); PL/UK/RU → `lng: pl`. Per-offer match uses **all study languages** from taxonomy (`language` — bilingual `polski/angielski` matches PL and EN promos). EN/UK/RU labels via `home-promos/promo-i18n.php`. Load order for PROMOS: **15-min transient cache → Google Apps Script (Excel) → `prices.json` emergency fallback**. Matching uses bulk language/city term load, not per-post queries.
- **Homepage Promocje (EN):** section hidden (`home_promos` `show` forced off) — EN sheet promos are PL-study only; UK/RU/PL show section with i18n copy.
- **JSON-LD promos (bachelor/master):** `akademiata_schema_get_promos_from_prices_json()` — **same `prices.json` as tuition** (no Google/transient). Re-reads when file mtime changes. After SFTP/deploy of `prices.json` → **clear WP Rocket** so offer JSON-LD updates. Filter: `akademiata_schema_degree_eligible_promos`.
- **Header teaser:** link “SPRAWDŹ CENNIK” to `#tuition_fees` when `logical_sync_key` is set (no CPT price row).

## Postgraduate / MBA

- **Data:** ACF on the offer post — `payments`, `full_time`, `part_time`, column title fields, `more_info`.
- **PHP:** `configure/offer-pricing.php` (`akademiata_pg_mba_*`).
- **Templates:** `template-parts/single-offer/pg-mba/` (`section-tuition-fees.php`, `partials/price-table-acf.php`, `tuition-payments.php`, `bank-transfer-info.php`).
- **Payments repeater:** title, price, currency, optional `description` (no `promotion` checkbox on rows).
- **Table promos:** column flags like `add_promotion_rat8` in `full_time` / `part_time` grids.
- **Teaser price:** `akademiata_pg_mba_get_teaser_price_text()` from first row `col_8_rat`.

## Prices page

`page-template-prices.php` includes the same `calculator.php` without fixed key (full program picker).

## Temporary recruitment-fee promos (hardcoded)

- UI: `#rekr-promos` in `calculator.php` (above one-time enrollment fees); copy in `prices-i18n` → `rekrPromo`.
- Logic: `prices-calculator.js` — cards `absolwent` / `kurs`; mutual exclusive; no default selection.
- Effect: selected card sets admission fee to **0** + green tile (`.ei--rekr-zero`); does not change Excel/Apps Script.
- Badge / “oszczędzasz”: `{amount}` from `item.rekr` (85 → −85 zł, 150 → −150 zł).
- Visibility: hide after **2026-10-31**; UABY off; Interior Architecture → none; Architektura I / Wzornictwo I → no `kurs`; `absolwent` only PL study language + 2nd cycle; EN study language → `kurs` only.
- Dates in copy: base 30.08 / 30.09; after 30.08.2026 auto-extend once to 30.09 / 30.10.

## Temporary Zarządzanie PL tuition (until 31 Oct 2026)

- **Scope:** all `k: Zarządzanie` rows, Warsaw + Wrocław, study lang PL (`window.lang === 'pl'`). Not EN Management, not „Zarządzanie i inżynieria produkcji”.
- **Rates (JS override in `prices-calculator.js`; sheet unchanged):** I stacjonarne 12×490 / 10×660; I niestacjonarne 12×450 / 10×620; II niestacjonarne 12×590 / 10×770. II stacjonarne unchanged.
- **Promos:** sheet `#promos` cards hidden; section title + Regulamin stay; `#promos-inner` empty (no explanatory copy). Rekr promos (`#rekr-promos`) unchanged. No stacking (`getEA` skipped).
- **UI:** plan cards show promo price + `standardowo {old} zł/ratę` (`.pc-was`, no strikethrough).
- **Listing `/oferta/`:** when `program=zarzadzanie` (PL/UK/RU UI), promo checkboxes disabled + grayed (`is-zarzadzanie-blocked`); no user-facing note. Helpers: `akademiata_is_zarzadzanie_price_override_active()`, `akademiata_offer_listing_zarzadzanie_promos_blocked()` in `offer-promotions-filter.php`.
- **Auto-off:** 1 Nov 2026 — revert to sheet prices + promos without deploy.

## Homepage Promocje (`home_promos`)

- **Copy (name / tag / dates):** `akademiata_get_calculator_promos()` — same PROMOS as calculator/listing; empty card fields filled from JSON; **EN/UK/RU** via `home-promos/promo-i18n.php` (dates synced from sheet); **expired promos hide the card**.
- **ACF (Front: Page → Promocje):** photos, layout, colors, badge — **wins when non-empty** (headline, value, meta, text, link).
- **Defaults:** `configure/front-page-defaults/home-promos/content*.php` — layout + `promo_id`; links default to `/oferta/?promo={id}` (`akademiata_get_oferta_page_id()` for WPML).
- **Listing deep link:** `?promo=` pre-checks promo filter on `page-offer.php` (`ajax-filter.js`).

## Homepage → calculator deep links (single offer)

- Calculator on offer singles still reads `?promo=` / `?rekr=` / `&sub=` (`prices-calculator.js`).

## Promo expiry (auto from text dates)

- PHP/JS parse `DD.MM.YYYY` dates from promo `short`/`full` text; the **latest** date = deadline.
- **End-of-month extension:** if deadline falls on last day of month → extend to end of next month, capped at **31 October** same year.
- Optional explicit `expires` field (column M in 🏷️ Promocje / `prices.json`) takes priority.
- PHP: `akademiata_promo_is_expired()` in `akademiata_get_calculator_promos()` (transient `v4`).
- JS: `isPromoExpired()` filters in `applyData()` before rendering.

## Maintenance

- Calculator/script changes: update `apps-script/`, redeploy web app URL in `js-css.php` if deployment ID changes.
- After taxonomy rewrite changes affecting `promocje`: flush permalinks.
